## Mercur Store API invariant

`/store/products` only returns products linked via `product_seller` to sellers with `status: open`. Seeding without seller → `count: 0`. Fix: `bun run seed:mdeai-catalog`.

## Commands

```bash
cd /home/sk/mdeai/mdeapp/commerce/mercur
bun run dev
bun run seed:mdeai-catalog    # idempotent — seller mdeai + 20 SKUs
bun run seed:seller           # seller only
```

**Verify Store API:**

```bash
source /home/sk/mdeai/mdeapp/commerce/.env  # or export MEDUSA_PUBLISHABLE_KEY
curl -s -H "x-publishable-api-key: $MEDUSA_PUBLISHABLE_KEY" \
  "http://localhost:9000/store/products?limit=25" | jq '{count, titles: [.products[].title]}'
```

Pass: `count >= 20`.

## Workflows import

Use `@mercurjs/core/workflows` (not deep paths):

```typescript
import { createSellersWorkflow, approveSellerWorkflow } from "@mercurjs/core/workflows";
```

Product + seller link: `createProductsWorkflow` with `additional_data: { seller_id }` (hooks in `@mercurjs/core`).

